__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The site itself. Built by gen.py from pages/*.md, and served by the Pages
# workflow from what it builds rather than from what is committed - so a
# checked-in copy is never read by anybody, and it made adding one page a
# forty-file diff that buried the change in its own output.
#
# Build it locally the same way the workflow does:
#
#     python3 gen.py
/*.html
/search-index.json
